// Black Dragon Disciple: high-level abilities

// Call Draconic Ancestor
@1 = ~Call Draconic Ancestor~
@2 = ~Call Draconic Ancestor

The Black Dragon Disciple calls Nydra'Nath, the spirit of a half black dragon ancestor, to fight at his side. A bloodrager, it flies into a rage as soon as it sees an enemy. It shrugs off weapons below +3, most spells and its descendant's own breath. The spirit, blurred like a ghost, fights with a two-handed sword dripping with acid (+3, 1d10 slashing + 2d6 acid; each hit may entangle the target in swamp plants or cover it with a swarm of insects that stops its spellcasting), beats its wings at enemies who come too close, and can breathe a line of acid once (10d8 acid damage, save vs. Breath for half). It is immune to acid, poison and fear.~
